{"id":"vod_sn_36385","vodId":"36385","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"双星之阴阳师","name_cn":"双星之阴阳师","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/ac83fea4dce3857e9c92811b7cd2efb8.jpg"},"summary":"自有人类以来，“污秽”就不断的现身骚扰着人世间的安稳和宁静，为了对抗污秽，一群名为“阴阳师”的人们勇敢的站了出来，加入到了战斗之中，用他们的智慧和勇气守护着人类。少年焰魔堂辘轳（花江夏树 配音）立志要成为史上最强阴阳师，却因为一场悲剧的发生而意识到灾难的不可逆转，遂放弃了理想，沦为路人。　　某日，一位名叫化野红绪（潘惠美 配音）的京都少女出现在了辘轳的身边，两人在误打误撞之中开始了同居生活。红绪铲除污秽的决心渐渐感化了辘轳，让他再度看到了希望，燃起了热血。与此同时，辘轳发现，红绪的哥哥石镜悠斗（村濑步 配音）和当年令自己失去一切的灾难有着千丝万缕的关联。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:42:44","playable":true,"episodeCount":50,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RRvvUCez9D1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mdSzpyKvNf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6NTr3FkRWE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7DUCDjHxjg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3y2dX18uSk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/w5RbHnbV3H1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9gwHvYhrZe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XNwxY4bZBB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jWQKQAQCyt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6Wmu40XgQY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/V2eRSsjvJT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zesG501Hr81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ucYG7wFBVb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YdAi965TN71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","ur